  "body": "Some homes make an impression. This one makes you feel it from the moment you arrive.\r\n\r\nThat oversized front door sets the tone before you even step inside. Formerly a Versatile Homes show home in Millwater, this impressive residence brings together quality finishes, clever design and generous proportions in a home that feels a little bit special at every turn.\r\n\r\nWith an impressive 271 sqm floor area spread across two levels, there's room for the whole family to live large. Four generous bedrooms and three separate living areas give everyone space to spread out, while keeping family and friends connected when it matters most.\r\n\r\nThe entertainer's kitchen is ready for action, complete with a scullery to keep preparation tucked away while the conversation flows. And it's the thoughtful details that elevate this home: a separate laundry area for everyday practicality, and a clever disappearing pocket door in the media room that lets you create a dedicated movie-watching retreat when it's time to switch off.\r\n\r\nThen there's the alfresco area. Prepare to fall in love.\r\n\r\nDesigned for long lunches, relaxed evenings and weekends that turn into dinner, this is outdoor entertaining with real wow factor. Corner sliding doors create a beautiful connection between indoor and outdoor living, while overhead skylights bring in natural light and electronic blinds offer added comfort and control throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nWhether you're hosting a crowd, firing up the barbecue or simply enjoying a quiet morning coffee, this is a space you'll find every excuse to use.\r\n\r\nSet on a corner site, the property offers even more to dream about, with potential to create your own backyard pool retreat, subject to site requirements and council approval. A substantial double garage with additional storage adds to the practicality, balancing the home's impressive entertaining credentials with the everyday needs of family life.\r\n\r\nAnd the lifestyle? Just as appealing. Spend sunny days at beautiful Red Beach or Orewa, explore the nearby coastline, or enjoy the shopping and cafés of Silverdale and Orewa. Families will appreciate the proximity to Silverdale Primary School, KingsWay School and Stella Maris Primary School, with motorway access making commuting that much easier.\r\n\r\nDesigned to impress. Thoughtfully finished. Made for living.\r\n\r\nFrom that unforgettable first impression at the front door to evenings spent entertaining under the skylights, 31 Colonial Drive is a home that deserves to be experienced in person.",
